[{"client_msg_id":"1f7d8cdd-6a3f-40ac-b7a1-8b0cbdf96778","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"指し直しで直るのならデバイスのリセットで何とかなったんでしょう","ts":"1628143511.019000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CReL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"77e06310-190d-432e-a216-97ffea280fa1","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"このあたりはドライバで処理してるからドライバがおかしいと誤動作しがち","ts":"1628143396.018400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i6XVr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"940ea6f2-9be6-471a-8285-5d8035bc1cc5","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ヘッドホン周りはかなり鬼門だった覚えがあります","ts":"1628143322.017600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"umeP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e45cac55-6794-4f8a-b682-5e7a3c9f9d02","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"手持ちのAndroid端末、もはやイヤホンジャックが存在しなかった。","ts":"1628141924.017100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2Db8p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e7ac0654-d897-4772-b386-dcc001d4f387","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"それはさすがにないですね","ts":"1628141853.016500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c3M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ec1c84e0-c775-4711-b3cc-7f8e100bda44","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"ちなみに、音量ボタンを無意識に押してたりしないですよね？","ts":"1628141772.016100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"86h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6285f465-f097-4e2d-8684-850933f2cae4","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"しかしこれみんな起きてるっぽい? Android の一般的な問題なのかな","ts":"1628141704.015500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sCQnU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"34165a9d-17e3-426e-8d6f-69caa0cd4daf","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"マイク付きの4極で通信on/off、ボリュームをどうやってるかについては把握できてないのでなんとも...","ts":"1628141646.015000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yka4n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ac319c84-ab4a-4765-801a-1c4f615a11ff","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"USB DAC越しの接続にしてるため、スマホは問題でてない、素で指すFireタブででてる","ts":"1628141596.014200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qltH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"939cfeb4-7fc0-47f0-be94-0d87ad47bd31","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"音量の UI がちらっと出るのでそれでアプリがなんらかの割り込みを認識(誤認識)して、通信切断処理を入れちゃってるのだと思っています…","ts":"1628141582.013900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zsK/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01f49cf6-0898-492b-a913-1b51a038c1f8","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ちょっと接触がよくないイヤフォンで回転させると再生停止することは多い、音量はいまんとこないですね","ts":"1628141551.012900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dSPl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"88838bd8-74fd-480e-82a4-30f93c8171e8","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"イヤホンジャックに挿したデバイスの種類なんて識別できるんですかね? マイク付きとかはできるかもだけど、個別識別までだとどうなんだろう","ts":"1628141518.012100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q9W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e2221a7a-76d3-4a86-922e-68b581255606","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"勘違いというよりは、4極のところに制御と同等のノイズがのったとかですかね?","ts":"1628141511.011800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RpV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35dfbfcf-4b5b-452e-b20f-be6259061c3d","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"プレイ中に一旦接続が切断されてると判定されてるかも？","ts":"1628141507.011600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lsu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"497135fb-eb39-4e64-a626-126828ebebef","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"Android も Windows もですが、デバイスごとに最後の音量を覚えてて、それに合わせるってのはありますね","ts":"1628141476.009900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BvDW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7a813219-ffc8-44d3-af9f-40caed9aafc9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"一番困るのが、音量が変わると UI が出てくるんですよね…で、リズムゲームで通信プレイしているとその一瞬で通信が切れて不正プレイヤー扱いされるんですよ…つらい…","ts":"1628141459.009600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1Dx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa1fa404-e1be-47c7-80e4-f2041993219e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"抜いて挿し直すと戻るんですよね。音量を手動で調整している感じとはちょっと違う気もしています…","ts":"1628141397.008200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V/nR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b514e652-27c3-410a-9684-2e5b2c6f1411","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"同じ事ある勢です\n勝手な妄想ですが\n「コードの途中にコントローラーあるタイプのイヤホンだと勘違いした上で音量上げの信号押しっぱなしにしてると処理されている」的な誤動作だと思ってます","ts":"1628141276.006900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yfm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1e0ac1d4-5403-4859-a465-5d7d46307a8f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Android に有線イヤホンを挿して使っていると、たまに勝手に音量がめちゃでかくなったりすることがあるんですけど、同じ人っていますかね…? あるいは解決方法知ってる人いたら教えてもらえると助かります…","ts":"1628140938.002700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5ELb"}]}]
